@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontColor #000000
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #000000
skinparam ComponentFontColor #000000
skinparam RectangleBorderColor #000000
skinparam RectangleFontColor #000000

title GitHub PR Flow After Bound-Issue Guarantee

actor "LLM / Agent" as Agent #E8F0FE
component "MCP Server\nGitHub Wrapper" as Wrapper #D9EAD3
component "Issue Resolver\n(closing keyword parser + issue existence check)" as Resolver #FFF4CC
component "Issue Creator\n(template-enforced)" as Creator #D0E0FF
component "PR Body Binder\n(appends Closes #n)" as Binder #FCE5CD
component "GitHub REST API" as Api #FFE5E5
database "Repository" as Repo #EAF7EA

Agent --> Wrapper : github_create_pull_request_from_template
Wrapper --> Resolver : find existing bound issue
Resolver --> Api : get issue by referenced number(s)

Resolver --> Creator : no valid issue found
Creator --> Api : create issue

Wrapper --> Binder : ensure closing keyword reference
Binder --> Api : create PR with linked issue reference
Api --> Repo : issue + PR persisted and linked

note bottom of Wrapper #F3F3F3
PR path now guarantees a linked issue.
If issue is missing, it is auto-created first.
end note

@enduml

